---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
description: Brooke Reports helps you understand how persuasion works—so you can notice what's really going on beneath the surface and make clearer, calmer decisions.
schemaType: Organization
---

{# ======================================================== #}
{# HERO                                                      #}
{# ======================================================== #}
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero__inner">

    <div class="hero__text">
      <p class="eyebrow hero__eyebrow">Marketing Psychology &amp; Persuasion Literacy</p>
      <h1 class="hero__headline">
        <span class="hero__line">Read the Room.</span>
        <span class="hero__line">Spot the Pressure.</span>
        <span class="hero__line hero__line--italic"><em><span class="hero__drawn">Think More Clearly.</span></em></span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero__lede">Brooke Reports helps you understand how persuasion works—so you can notice what's really going on beneath the surface and make clearer, calmer decisions.</p>
      <div class="hero__ctas">
        <a href="/blog/" class="btn btn-primary">Start Reading <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a href="/second-look/" class="btn btn-ghost">See Second Look</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    {#
      IMAGE: hero-collage
      Aspect ratio: 4:5 (560 × 700px)
      Provide in src/assets/images/:
        hero-collage.jpg           560 × 700   JPEG fallback
        hero-collage-560.webp      560 × 700
        hero-collage-800.webp      800 × 1000
        hero-collage-1120.webp    1120 × 1400  (2× retina)
      Shoot/export source at 1120 × 1400px or larger.
    #}
    <div class="hero__collage" aria-hidden="true">
      <img
        src="/assets/images/hero-collage.jpg"
        srcset="
          /assets/images/hero-collage-560.webp   560w,
          /assets/images/hero-collage-800.webp   800w,
          /assets/images/hero-collage-1120.webp 1120w
        "
        sizes="(min-width: 800px) 50vw, 100vw"
        alt=""
        width="560"
        height="700"
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
      >
    </div>

  </div>

  <img class="hero__tear" src="/assets/images/torn-paper.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
</section>


{# ======================================================== #}
{# FEATURED REPORTS                                          #}
{# ======================================================== #}
<section class="featured-reports">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="featured-reports__header">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Featured Reports</p>
        <h2 class="featured-reports__heading">New Ideas.<br>Deeper Signals.</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="/blog/" class="featured-reports__all">View all reports <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>

    <div class="featured-reports__grid">
      {% for post in collections.posts | limit(4) %}
      <article class="report-card">

        <div class="report-card__image">
          {% if post.data.image %}
          <img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="" width="280" height="175" loading="lazy">
          {% else %}
          <div class="report-card__placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="report-card__body">
          {% if post.data.category %}
          <p class="eyebrow report-card__eyebrow">{{ post.data.category }}</p>
          {% endif %}
          <h3 class="report-card__title">
            <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
          </h3>
          {% if post.data.description %}
          <p class="report-card__excerpt">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
          {% endif %}
          <footer class="report-card__meta">
            <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
            {% if post.data.readTime %}
            <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><span>{{ post.data.readTime }} min read</span>
            {% endif %}
          </footer>
        </div>

      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


{# ======================================================== #}
{# SECOND LOOK PROMO                                         #}
{# ======================================================== #}
{#
  IMAGE: second-look-bg
  Dark/moody desk + books + ephemera photo, full-width
  Provide at 1440px wide, JPG
  When ready: uncomment background-image in .second-look-promo in CSS
#}
<section class="second-look-promo">
  <div class="wrap second-look-promo__inner">

    <div class="second-look-promo__lead">
      <p class="eyebrow">Calm. Clear. Useful.</p>
      <h2>Second Look</h2>
      <p class="second-look-promo__desc">A practical tool for evaluating persuasive offers, claims, and choices—so you can respond less, and decide better.</p>
      <a href="/second-look/" class="second-look-promo__link">Learn how it works <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>

    <div class="second-look-promo__features">

      <div class="second-look-feature">
        <div class="second-look-feature__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"
               stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="26" height="26">
            <path d="M18 11V6.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-3 0v-.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-3 0v-.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-3 0V11l-1.5-2a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-2.6 1.5L8.5 16A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 14 19h1a5 5 0 0 0 5-5v-3h-2z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="second-look-feature__title">Pause the Pitch</p>
          <p class="second-look-feature__desc">Step out of the moment so you can think straight.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="second-look-feature">
        <div class="second-look-feature__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"
               stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="26" height="26">
            <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/>
            <path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="second-look-feature__title">Check the Claims</p>
          <p class="second-look-feature__desc">Look for what's true, what's missing, and what's implied.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="second-look-feature">
        <div class="second-look-feature__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"
               stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="26" height="26">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="second-look-feature__title">Spot the Pressure</p>
          <p class="second-look-feature__desc">Name the tactics. Reduce the influence.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="second-look-feature">
        <div class="second-look-feature__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"
               stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="26" height="26">
            <path d="M12 22c5.523 0 10-4.477 10-10S17.523 2 12 2 2 6.477 2 12s4.477 10 10 10z"/>
            <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="second-look-feature__title">Choose with Clarity</p>
          <p class="second-look-feature__desc">Make decisions that fit your values and your goals.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>


{# ======================================================== #}
{# ABOUT TEASER                                              #}
{# ======================================================== #}
<section class="about-teaser">
  <div class="wrap about-teaser__inner">

    {#
      IMAGE: about-image
      Atmospheric — books, candlelight, study scene
      Aspect ratio: 3:4
      Provide in src/assets/images/:
        about-image.jpg           400 × 533   JPEG fallback
        about-image-400.webp      400 × 533
        about-image-800.webp      800 × 1066  (2× retina)
    #}
    <div class="about-teaser__image">
      <img
        src="/assets/images/about-image.jpg"
        srcset="
          /assets/images/about-image-400.webp  400w,
          /assets/images/about-image-800.webp  800w
        "
        sizes="(min-width: 900px) 28vw, 100vw"
        alt=""
        width="400"
        height="533"
        loading="lazy"
      >
    </div>

    <div class="about-teaser__body">
      <p class="eyebrow">About Brooke Reports</p>
      <h2>Thoughtful. Sharp. Anti-Hype.</h2>
      <p>Brooke Reports is an independent media and education brand exploring marketing psychology, influence, and human behavior. We believe understanding persuasion makes you more free—not more cynical.</p>
      <ul class="about-teaser__values" aria-label="Our values">
        <li>
          <div class="about-teaser__value-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"
                 stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20">
              <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/>
              <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
              <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/>
              <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Evidence over noise.</strong>
            <p>We research deeply and write clearly.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="about-teaser__value-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"
                 stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
              <path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"/>
              <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Curious, not cynical.</strong>
            <p>We ask better questions instead of rushing to conclusions.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="about-teaser__value-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"
                 stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20">
              <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Human first.</strong>
            <p>Because behind every decision is a real person.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="about-teaser__quote-wrap">
      <blockquote class="about-teaser__quote">
        <p>The goal isn't to resist everything. It's to recognize what's real—so you can choose what matters.</p>
        <cite>— Brooke</cite>
      </blockquote>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
